meta {
  name: Get Manga Details
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/manga/:id
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: one-piece.49
}

assert {
  res.status: in [200, 404]
}

docs {
  # Get Manga Details
  Fetches full metadata and chapter count for the specified manga ID. Also registers the series in the local SQLite state tracker (`library.db`).

  ### Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `id` | string | **Yes** | Manga Katana slug identifier (e.g. `one-piece.49`). |

  ### Responses
  - **`200 OK`**: JSON object containing manga details.
    ```json
    {
      "id": "one-piece.49",
      "title": "One Piece",
      "alt_titles": ["OP"],
      "description": "Gol D. Roger...",
      "authors": ["Oda Eiichiro"],
      "artists": ["Oda Eiichiro"],
      "genres": ["Action", "Adventure"],
      "status": "Ongoing",
      "cover_url": "https://img.mangakatana.com/covers/..."
    }
    ```
  - **`400 Bad Request`**: If the manga ID contains illegal path characters.
  - **`404 Not Found`**: If the manga is not found upstream.
}
